# What Shimpaku needs on every device: gNMI in clear text on 32767 in the management instance
# (docs/RESEARCH.md R2; the collector dials in with the lab credentials). Lab-only: no TLS.
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi port 32767
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi routing-instance mgmt_junos
set system services http servers server shimpaku-gnmi grpc gnmi
# RPM probe owner shimpaku (docs/build/rpm-config.set): campus users (VLAN 10, instance USER) to servers
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers probe-type icmp-ping
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers target address 10.20.0.1
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers routing-instance USER
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers probe-count 5
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers probe-interval 1
set services rpm probe shimpaku test users-servers test-interval 10
